Native Partion，可以參考link:[另一篇博文（尚未書寫）]。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>使用 Ambari 安裝 Hdp 集羣</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/2018/10/ambari-hdp-demo/</link><pubDate>Sat, 13 Oct 2018 11:24:08 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/2018/10/ambari-hdp-demo/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/categories/archived/">Archived</category><description>&lt;p>HDP 並不是 hadoop 的輔音簡稱，而是 Hortonworks 的產品 &lt;a href="https://community.hortonworks.com/questions/89821/difference-between-apache-hadoop-and-hdp.html"target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer">Hortonworks Data
